          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Smart Furniture showrooms span across Egypt, from the North Coast to Aswan, allowing customers to experience our collections firsthand:&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Consistent pricing across all showrooms&nbsp;</li><li>Walk-in visits welcome; personalized assistance by appointment&nbsp;</li><li>Wide selection of living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, dining sets, and mattresses&nbsp;</li><li>Selected items available for fast delivery from 48 hours&nbsp;</li><li>Expert guidance on layout, selection, and customization</li></ul>"
